[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9240.15, "timestamp": "02:34:00", "text": "八。是的。啊，不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9242.15, "timestamp": "02:34:02", "text": "它觉得怎么样？我觉得我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9245.59, "timestamp": "02:34:05", "text": "可能先去接电话，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9247.59, "timestamp": "02:34:07", "text": "搞定这个东西。或许是因为这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9254.15, "timestamp": "02:34:14", "text": "因为我这样做，所以事情就向前发展了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9256.95, "timestamp": "02:34:16", "text": "但我正在为你调整追踪器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9259.349, "timestamp": "02:34:19", "text": "看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9262.79, "timestamp": "02:34:22", "text": "我要转动追踪器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9266.23, "timestamp": "02:34:26", "text": "你看到我的手也跟着它转动。是的。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9269.91, "timestamp": "02:34:29", "text": "它突然向右偏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9271.07, "timestamp": "02:34:31", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9274.63, "timestamp": "02:34:34", "text": "别去想它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9277.11, "timestamp": "02:34:37", "text": "我认为校准是一项艰巨的任务。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9280.79, "timestamp": "02:34:40", "text": "正确的？是的。呃，还有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9283.15, "timestamp": "02:34:43", "text": "价格相当便宜。我拿到了全部八个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9287.79, "timestamp": "02:34:47", "text": "160. 我把钱交给他们，但他们还是输了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9293.19, "timestamp": "02:34:53", "text": "呃，之后它们经常不同步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9295.67, "timestamp": "02:34:55", "text": "但它们可能足以应付任何事情了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9298.469, "timestamp": "02:34:58", "text": "我想做。嗯。"}]